  "configuration_id": "config_019",
  "reason": "The current best result is config_018 (multimodal, multiprofile, PCA, ResNet50, avgpool, concat) with 0.6186 accuracy and 0.6103 F1, modestly above the best RNA-only multiprofile avgpool PCA result (0.5907/0.5727). Because only concat fusion has been tested and the image-only ResNet50 result was weak, it is unclear whether simple concatenation is already sufficient or whether weighted fusion can better balance the modalities. config_019 changes only the fusion method from concat to weighted, keeping the otherwise promising setup fixed. This is the most efficient next experiment because it directly exploits the current best direction while isolating the effect of fusion, which can either improve performance or clarify that concat is adequate before exploring larger changes."
}

